@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# VSCursed realm runtime
+
+The `.d.ts` files in this folder are the contract between VSCodium and the VSCursed realm runtime.
+The matching `.js` bundles are built by `@vscursed/runtime` in the VSCursed repository and are not
+tracked here. Each realm's composition root imports its bundle and starts it.
